        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14576\">issue #14576</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The current handling of <code>do_not_suspend</code> relies on stack-like behavior of sync tasks (LIFO) but recent spec changes means that this is no longer a guarantee. For example this test I believe should pass:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">#[tokio::test]</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#[cfg_attr(miri, ignore)]</span>\n<span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">concurrent_sync_typed_calls_with_yield</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">Result</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Engine</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Component</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"s\">r#\"</span>\n<span class=\"s\">(component</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core func $thread.yield (canon thread.yield))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core func $task.return (canon task.return))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core module $m</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"\" \"thread.yield\" (func $yield (result i32)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (import \"\" \"task.return\" (func $task.return))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (global $s1-running (mut i32) (i32.const 0))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"s1\")</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (global.set $s1-running (i32.const 1))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (drop (call $yield))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (global.set $s1-running (i32.const 0)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"s2\")</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (if (global.get $s1-running) (then unreachable))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">      (drop (call $yield)))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"noop\") (result i32) (call $task.return) (i32.const 0)) ;; EXIT</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (func (export \"cb\") (param i32 i32 i32) (result i32) unreachable))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (core instance $i (instantiate $m (with \"\" (instance</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (export \"thread.yield\" (func $thread.yield))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (export \"task.return\" (func $task.return))))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (func (export \"s1\") (canon lift (core func $i \"s1\")))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (func (export \"s2\") (canon lift (core func $i \"s2\")))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">  (func (export \"noop\") async</span>\n<span class=\"s\">    (canon lift (core func $i \"noop\") async (callback (core func $i \"cb\"))))</span>\n<span class=\"s\">)</span>\n<span class=\"s\">        \"#</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Store</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">());</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Linker</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">engine</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instantiate_async</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">component</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_typed_func</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"s1\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_typed_func</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"s2\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">noop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instance</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_typed_func</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">store</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"noop\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">store</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run_concurrent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">accessor</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">futures</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">future</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">try_join</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"n\">s1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">call_concurrent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accessor</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"n\">s2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">call_concurrent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accessor</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">})</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"o\">??</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">store</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run_concurrent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">accessor</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">noop</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">call_concurrent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accessor</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">()).</span><span class=\"k\">await</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">await</span><span class=\"o\">??</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nb\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">(())</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>but it currently traps.</p>\n<p>More wast tests, and an LLM summary if useful, can be found at <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/alexcrichton/6ff5e1688251f5988efca3fc9a83c705\">https://gist.github.com/alexcrichton/6ff5e1688251f5988efca3fc9a83c705</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
